  {
    "id": "https://openalex.org/W4206555949",
    "doi": "https://doi.org/10.3410/f.12039956.13180054",
    "title": "Faculty Opinions recommendation of Prestin-driven cochlear amplification is not limited by the outer hair cell membrane time constant.",
